@startuml WMS_Architecture_Simple

!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title ShipOra WMS - High Level Architecture

' Main Systems
component "OMS" as OMS #LightBlue
component "WMS Service" as WMS #LightGreen
database "WMS DB" as DB #LightYellow
component "IMS" as IMS #LightBlue
component "DMS" as DMS #LightBlue

' Integration Layer
interface "ESB 1" as ESB1 #Orange
interface "ESB 3" as ESB3 #Orange

' Flows
OMS -> WMS : 1. Create Order\n(POST /fulfillment)

WMS <--> DB : Persist Data

WMS --> ESB1 : 2. Check Location
ESB1 --> IMS

WMS -> WMS : 3. Packaging\n(Internal Calc)

WMS --> ESB3 : 4. Dispatch Delivery
ESB3 --> DMS

note right of WMS
  **Workflow:**
  1. Receive Order
  2. Locate Item (via IMS)
  3. Package Item
  4. Request Delivery (via DMS)
end note

@enduml
